@c2j @lgpang Now MindSpore has officially supported docker images with both CPU and GPU backend:
- CPU: `docker pull mindspore/mindspore-cpu:0.1.0-alpha`
- GPU (Cuda 10.1): `docker pull mindspore/mindspore-cuda10.1:0.1.0-alpha`
- GPU (Cuda 9.2): `docker pull mindspore/mindspore-cuda9.2:0.1.0-alpha`

Please have a try, and be free to ask if you have any question.

